{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/national-risk-register-2025","content_id":"dc1ae6f1-eeae-4174-90d5-3427ff34ea9b","description":"The National Risk Register outlines the most serious risks facing the United Kingdom","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"accessible.formats@cabinetoffice.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"67b5f85732b2aab18314bbe4","filename":"National_Risk_Register_2025.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":4963486,"filename":"National_Risk_Register_2025.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"8473676","isbn":"","number_of_pages":187,"title":"National Risk Register 2025","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/67b5f85732b2aab18314bbe4/National_Risk_Register_2025.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The National Risk Register (NRR) is the external version of the National Security Risk Assessment (NSRA), which is the government’s assessment of the most serious risks facing the UK. It provides the government’s updated assessment of the likelihood and potential impact of a broad range of risks that may directly affect the UK and its interests. </p>\n\n<p>The NRR is aimed at risk and resilience practitioners, including businesses and voluntary and community sector organisations. Information for individuals, households and communities on preparing for emergencies can be found on <a rel=\"external\" href=\"http://gov.uk/prepare\">GOV.UK/Prepare</a></p>\n\n<p>The NSRA now operates as a dynamic assessment process, with risks reassessed on a more regular basis to reflect the changing risk landscape. This version of the National Risk Register is the first to align with that dynamic process, drawing from the latest risk information available.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-01-16T00:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Guidance","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;file_download&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/67b5f85732b2aab18314bbe4/National_Risk_Register_2025.pdf\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--pdf\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 99 140\">\n  <path d=\"M12,59h9v9h-9v-9ZM30,77v9h39v-9H30ZM30,104h57v-9H30v9ZM30,122h48v-9H30v9ZM12,86h9v-9h-9v9ZM12,122h9v-9h-9v9ZM12,104h9v-9h-9v9ZM30,68h57v-9H30v9ZM35.2,21c-.3-.2-.6-.4-1-.5s-.8-.2-1.3-.2h-2.6v5.5h2.6c.5,0,1,0,1.3-.2s.7-.3,1-.5c.3-.2.5-.5.7-.8s.2-.7.2-1.1h0c0-.5,0-.9-.2-1.2-.2-.3-.4-.6-.7-.8h0ZM52.4,21.9c-.4-.5-1-.9-1.6-1.1-.7-.3-1.5-.4-2.4-.4h-2.7v11.5h2.7c.9,0,1.7-.1,2.4-.4s1.2-.7,1.6-1.1c.4-.5.7-1.1.9-1.7.2-.7.3-1.4.3-2.1v-.7c0-.8,0-1.5-.3-2.1-.2-.6-.5-1.2-.9-1.7h0ZM87,12v27H12V12h75ZM39.8,23c0-.9-.1-1.6-.4-2.4-.3-.7-.7-1.4-1.2-1.9-.5-.5-1.2-1-1.9-1.2-.8-.3-1.6-.5-2.5-.5h-7.2v17.9h3.6v-6h3.2c.9,0,1.8-.1,2.6-.5.8-.3,1.4-.7,2-1.2.5-.5,1-1.2,1.3-1.9.3-.7.5-1.5.5-2.4h0ZM57.4,26c0-1.3-.2-2.6-.5-3.7s-.9-2-1.6-2.8c-.7-.8-1.6-1.4-2.7-1.8-1.1-.4-2.3-.6-3.8-.6h-6.6v17.9h6.6c1.5,0,2.7-.2,3.8-.6,1.1-.4,2-1,2.7-1.8.7-.8,1.3-1.7,1.6-2.8.4-1.1.5-2.3.5-3.7h0ZM72.4,17.1h-12.1v17.9h3.6v-7.5h7.8v-3.3h-7.8v-3.8h8.4s0-3.3,0-3.3Z\" />\n</svg>\n\n</a></div>\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__details\">\n    <h2 class=\"gem-c-attachment__title\">\n      <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;file_download&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/67b5f85732b2aab18314bbe4/National_Risk_Register_2025.pdf\">National Risk Register 2025</a>\n</h2>\n\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\"><abbr title=\"Portable Document Format\" class=\"gem-c-attachment__abbr\">PDF</abbr></span>, <span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">4.73 MB</span>, <span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">187 pages</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n</div></section>"],"emphasised_organisations":["96ae61d6-c2a1-48cb-8e67-da9d105ae381"],"featured_attachments":["8473676"],"first_public_at":"2025-01-16T00:00:00.000+00:00","political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"guidance","first_published_at":"2025-01-16T00:00:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/national-risk-register-2025","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/national-risk-register-2025","base_path":"/government/publications/national-risk-register-2025","content_id":"dc1ae6f1-eeae-4174-90d5-3427ff34ea9b","document_type":"guidance","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-01-16T00:00:00Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"National Risk Register 2025","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/national-risk-register-2025","withdrawn":false}],"document_collections":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/collections/thematic-resilience-guidance","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/collections/thematic-resilience-guidance","base_path":"/government/collections/thematic-resilience-guidance","content_id":"e7b3d615-cbb6-4903-a258-eaf370b5356b","document_type":"document_collection","links":{"documents":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/national-risk-register-2025","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/national-risk-register-2025","base_path":"/government/publications/national-risk-register-2025","content_id":"dc1ae6f1-eeae-4174-90d5-3427ff34ea9b","document_type":"guidance","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-01-16T00: